# P5 U3 (fx 5e32bce2), from the other side: the same answer drawn on a light
# screen first, then a report of dark and one of light again. The launch is
# light through COLORFGBG (white background), which both products read once
# the OSC 11 query goes unanswered, as it does here; neither pin (FX_THEME,
# XFX_THEME) is set, because a pin locks live updates out. So the light-drawn
# comment (243), keyword (238), string (241) and inline code (235) are what the
# dark report recolours.
gateway p5-inline-code-retint-turns.json
fx: env FX_AUTO_UPGRADE=0
env COLORFGBG='0;15'
wait 4
type show me the code
wait 1
key Enter
wait 8
snap light
key -H 1b 5b 3f 39 39 37 3b 31 6e
wait 2
snap dark
key -H 1b 5b 3f 39 39 37 3b 32 6e
wait 2
snap light-again
